@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Figures that the CONSOLIDATION'S EDITORIAL NOTES give for ss 44, 45 and 46. NOT ENCODED LAW.
--
-- Hebrew Wikisource, the deposited source (../../registers/source-bundle/income-tax-ordinance-new-version.he.wiki.txt, sha256
-- b87f2cf437ccfed35c3164681f4fc7ee015a111633454622751930c8894b81b6, retrieved 2026-10-06), prints in square-bracket notes the amounts that s 46 adjusts
-- under s 120B and the income ceilings of regulations that are not in the source bundle. The notes are the consolidation's (CC BY-SA 4.0), an aid; the
-- statute prints only the nominal amounts (180 and 9,000,000, "נקוב לשנת 2012"). The one other source for the s 46 amounts is the Tax Authority's
-- publications, which this row did not fetch (the brief forbids fetching); so the note is the figure used, and the tests say so.
--
-- (a) s 46(a): the minimum donation and the absolute ceiling, for 2024 to 2027 (line 1745).
-- (b) ss 44 and 45: the income ceilings of "the regulations of 5756-1996" (lines 1705, 1712): 182,000 (individual) and 291,000 (couple) in 2023;
--     188,000 and 301,000 in 2024 to 2027. These are NOT USED by any rule of this row. The regulations are not in the source bundle, the
--     note does not say how the ceiling works (what income, whether a couple's means both spouses', whether it is a condition of the credit or
--     a limit on it), and a rule that guessed would invent the regulations' text. So ss 44 and 45 take "the conditions of the regulations are met" as an input
--     (nouns: `Whether the conditions of the regulations made under a section are met`) and decline where it is not known. The figures are recorded
--     here so that a caller who has read the regulations can check his input against the note.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Figures of the consolidation's notes for sections 44, 45 and 46 — not encoded law`

-- src:1705 | [note: פורסמו תקנות מס הכנסה (זיכוי בעד נטול יכולת וזיכוי בעד הוצאות בשל החזקת קרוב במוסד), התשנ״ו–1996; תקרת ההכנסה המזכה: בשנת 2023, 182,000 ש״ח ליחיד, 291,000 ש״ח לזוג; בשנים 2024–2027, 188,000 ש״ח ליחיד, 301,000 ש״ח לזוג.]
-- src:1745 | (א) אדם שתרם בשנת מס פלונית סכום העולה על 180 שקלים חדשים [note: (נקוב לשנת 2012; בשנת 2023, 200 ש״ח; בשנים 2024–2027, 207 ש״ח)] לקרן לאומית, או למוסד ציבורי כמשמעותו בסעיף 9(2) שקבע לענין זה שר האוצר באישור ועדת הכספים של הכנסת, יזוכה מהמס שהוא חייב בו באותה שנה בשיעור של 35% מסכום התרומה – אם הוא יחיד, ובשיעור הקבוע בסעיף 126(א) מסכום התרומה – אם הוא חבר־בני־אדם, ובלבד שלא יינתן זיכוי בשנת מס פלונית בשל סכום כולל של תרומות העולה על 30% מההכנסה החייבת של הנישום באותה שנה או על 9,000,000 שקלים חדשים [note: (נקוב לשנת 2012; בשנת 2023, 10,019,808 ש״ח; בשנים 2024–2027, 10,354,816 ש״ח)], לפי הנמוך מביניהם (להלן – התקרה לזיכוי); סכום העולה על התקרה לזיכוי שנתרם באותה שנת מס, יזוכה מהמס בהתאם להוראות סעיף זה בשלוש שנות המס הבאות בזו אחר זו, ובלבד שלא יינתן זיכוי בכל אחת משלוש שנות המס כאמור, בשל סכום כולל של תרומות העולה על התקרה לזיכוי.

@ref the consolidation's note, line 1745; no figure for this tax year in the note
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the consolidation's note gives no amounts for section 46 for this tax year` MEANS
    REFUSE "the consolidation's note gives no amounts for section 46 for this tax year"

-- NIS: the minimum donation and the absolute ceiling, for 2024 to 2027 (the note: "בשנים 2024–2027, 207 ש״ח", "10,354,816 ש״ח").
@ref the consolidation's note on s 46(a), line 1745
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER  @desc the tax year, 2024 to 2027
GIVETH A `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year`
`the amounts of section 46 that the consolidation's note gives for tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    IF   `the tax year` AT LEAST 2024 AND `the tax year` AT MOST 2027
    THEN `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year` OF 207, 10354816
    ELSE `the consolidation's note gives no amounts for section 46 for this tax year`

DECLARE `The income ceilings the consolidation's note gives for the regulations of 5756-1996` HAS
    `for an individual`                                                              IS A NUMBER
    `for a couple`                                                                   IS A NUMBER

@ref the consolidation's note on ss 44 and 45, lines 1705, 1712 — recorded, not used by any rule
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the consolidation's note gives no income ceilings for the regulations of 5756-1996 for this tax year` MEANS
    REFUSE "the consolidation's note gives no income ceilings for the regulations of 5756-1996 for this tax year"

@ref the consolidation's note on ss 44 and 45, lines 1705, 1712 — recorded, not used by any rule
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER  @desc the tax year, 2023 to 2027
GIVETH A `The income ceilings the consolidation's note gives for the regulations of 5756-1996`
`the income ceilings of the regulations of 5756-1996, as the consolidation's note gives them for tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2023 THEN `The income ceilings the consolidation's note gives for the regulations of 5756-1996` OF 182000, 291000
           IF `the tax year` AT LEAST 2024 AND `the tax year` AT MOST 2027 THEN `The income ceilings the consolidation's note gives for the regulations of 5756-1996` OF 188000, 301000
           OTHERWISE `the consolidation's note gives no income ceilings for the regulations of 5756-1996 for this tax year`
